&lt;h2>Notes&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="notes">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#notes" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>current_now&lt;/strong> : Current in microamperes.
some systems may report only positive values. In this case, charging status can be used to determine the direction of the current.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>charge_now&lt;/strong> : Charge in microampere-hours.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>capacity&lt;/strong> : Battery capacity in percentage.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>voltage_now&lt;/strong> : Voltage in microvolts.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>temperature&lt;/strong> : Battery temperature in Celsius.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>charging status&lt;/strong> :
&lt;table>
&lt;thead>
&lt;tr>
&lt;th>Status&lt;/th>
&lt;th>Value&lt;/th>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/thead>
&lt;tbody>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>Charging&lt;/td>
&lt;td>1&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>Discharging&lt;/td>
&lt;td>-1&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>Full&lt;/td>
&lt;td>0&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>Unknown&lt;/td>
&lt;td>0&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
